  "desc": "Covering letter for documents or an application.",
  "icon": "✉️",
  "html": "<p><strong>Date:</strong> [Insert Date]</p><p>To,                      <br>[Recipient’s Name]<br>[Designation]<br>[Company Name]<br>[Address]</p><p><strong>Subject:</strong> Application for [Job Title]</p><p>Dear [Sir/Madam],</p><p>I am writing to apply for the position of [Job Title] at [Company Name], as advertised on [source]. With [number] years of experience in [field/industry], I have developed strong skills in [mention relevant skills], which I believe will be valuable to your team.</p><p>My background includes [briefly highlight key achievements, education, or experiences relevant to the job]. I am highly motivated and eager to contribute positively to your organization’s goals.</p><p>Please find my resume attached for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my suitability for this role.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration.</p><p>Yours faithfully,<br>[Your Full Name]<br>[Contact Information]<br>[Email Address]</p>"
