  "icon": "🔑",
  "html": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>SUB-LEASE AGREEMENT</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">This Sub-Lease Agreement (\"Agreement\") is made on [Date] at [City], Pakistan, between:</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">\"SUB-LESSOR\": [Full Name], CNIC No. [___________], resident of [Address], who is the tenant/lessee of the property described below under the original lease dated [Date] with the owner [Owner's Name] (hereinafter \"Sub-Lessor\"); AND</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">\"SUB-LESSEE\": [Full Name], CNIC No. [___________], resident of [Address] (hereinafter \"Sub-Lessee\").</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>PROPERTY: [Full Description of the premises being sub-leased]</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>TERMS:</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. CONSENT: The Sub-Lessor declares that the owner/principal landlord has given written consent for this sub-lease / the terms of the original lease permit sub-letting.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">2. TERM: This Sub-Lease shall commence on [Date] and end on [Date], unless earlier terminated.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">3. RENT: The Sub-Lessee agrees to pay rent of Rs. [___________] per month, payable in advance by the [___] day of each month.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">4. SECURITY DEPOSIT: The Sub-Lessee shall deposit Rs. [___________] as refundable security (to be returned at end of term, subject to deductions for damages).</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">5. USE: The premises shall be used for [residential/commercial/office] purposes only.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">6. CONDITION: The Sub-Lessee accepts the premises in their current condition and shall return them in the same condition, fair wear and tear excepted.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">7. UTILITIES: [Electricity, gas, water, internet] charges shall be borne by the Sub-Lessee.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">8. RESTRICTIONS: The Sub-Lessee shall not further sub-let or assign without written consent.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">9. TERMINATION: Either party may terminate with [___] days' written notice.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">10. GOVERNING LAW: Pakistan/the applicable provincial rent law (Punjab Rented Premises Act, 2009 / Sindh Rented Premises Ordinance, 1979 / Islamabad Rent Restriction Ordinance, 2001 / Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Rented Premises Act, 2019).</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">____________________________        ____________________________</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">SUB-LESSOR                           SUB-LESSEE</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">[Name &amp; CNIC]                        [Name &amp; CNIC]</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">WITNESSES:</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. ___________________________   2. ___________________________</p>"
