  "icon": "💰",
  "html": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>[COMPANY NAME / ADVOCATE NAME]</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>[ADDRESS]</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Date: _______________</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Ref.: _______________</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">BY REGISTERED POST WITH ACKNOWLEDGEMENT DUE</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">To,</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">[Name of Debtor]</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">[Address]</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>DEMAND NOTICE FOR PAYMENT OF OUTSTANDING DUES</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Dear Sir/Madam,</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">This Notice is served upon you on behalf of [Name of Creditor/Client] (hereinafter \"Client\").</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Our Client draws your attention to the following outstanding dues:</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">[Description of Debt / Invoice Details]:</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Invoice No. [___] dated [Date]: Rs. [___]</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Invoice No. [___] dated [Date]: Rs. [___]</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Mark-up @ [___]% per annum from [Date] to date: Rs. [___]</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Total Outstanding: Rs. [___________]</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">The said outstanding dues have been owing since [Date] despite repeated oral and written reminders. You have failed and neglected to make payment without any justification.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">YOU ARE HEREBY REQUIRED to pay the total outstanding amount of Rs. [___________] (Rupees [Amount in Words] only) to our Client within SEVEN (07) DAYS of receipt of this Notice.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">Payment may be made by [crossed cheque / bank transfer to Account No. ___] in favour of [Client Name].</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">PLEASE TAKE NOTICE that in the event of your failure to make payment within the stipulated period, our Client shall initiate legal proceedings for recovery of the said amount along with mark-up, costs, and damages, at your risk and expense, without any further notice.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">____________________________</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">[Name of Advocate / Client Representative]</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">On behalf of [Client Name]</p>"
